flowchart TD
    D[Annual declaration filed by all officials] --> IGR[IG completeness review]
    IGR --> RA{Random audit selected?}
    RA -->|Yes| AUD[Full audit: ANI and procurement cross-checks]
    RA -->|No| REN[Clearance renewed]
    AUD --> RF{Red flag?}
    RF -->|No| REN
    RF -->|Yes| INV[IG investigation]
    INV --> CON{Violation confirmed?}
    CON -->|No| REN
    CON -->|Yes| ACT[Removal or criminal referral]
    REN -->|Next cycle| D
